WEBVTT

00:14:29.348 --> 00:14:30.505
sleep for dummies.

00:14:30.529 --> 00:14:32.649
(Laughter)

00:14:32.673 --> 00:14:35.458
Make your bedroom a haven for sleep.

00:14:35.482 --> 00:14:38.986
The first critical thing is make it
as dark as you possibly can,

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.851
and also make it slightly cool.

00:14:40.875 --> 00:14:42.027
Very important.

00:14:42.051 --> 00:14:44.957
Actually, reduce your amount
of light exposure

00:14:44.981 --> 00:14:47.330
at least half an hour
before you go to bed.

00:14:47.354 --> 00:14:50.107
Light increases levels of alertness
and will delay sleep.

00:14:50.131 --> 00:14:52.994
What's the last thing that most of us
do before we go to bed?

00:14:53.018 --> 00:14:55.387
We stand in a massively lit bathroom,

00:14:55.411 --> 00:14:57.506
looking into the mirror
cleaning our teeth.

00:14:57.530 --> 00:15:01.085
It's the worst thing we can possibly do
before we go to sleep.